# Normalise line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF, but a Windows checkout converted everything to CRLF, so the
# working tree and CI disagreed about file contents. That is not cosmetic: PHPStan bakes
# the offending text into its baseline messages, so a baseline generated on Windows
# contained `Unexpected token "\r\n ", ... at offset 16` while CI reported `"\n "` at
# offset 15 — the patterns stopped matching and static analysis failed on CI only.
#
# eol=lf makes every checkout agree with what CI sees.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.phar binary
